<title>UK: GECC sets 250 mln mark bond due Dec 2003.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 250 mln mark bond due Dec 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    02.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.57    PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.72     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.85	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPT 2003 NOTES BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
